%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: BleakFallsPart2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright... immediate problems... dealt with...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I slump down, back against the door.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess the adrenaline finally wore off... guhh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474842872840354
    - rid: 9079474842872840355
    - rid: 9079474842872840356
    - rid: 9079474842872840357
    - rid: 9079475089592287520
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, are you-'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474842872840358
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474842872840353
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474842872840362
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474842872840364
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hoo boy...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474842872840365
    - rid: 9079474842872840368
    - rid: 9079474842872840369
    - rid: 9079474842872840370
    - rid: 9079474842872840371
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori... you mind helping me get to that fire... over there?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474842872840372
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The five of us make our way to the campfire.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Natsuki, of course, gets really close to it and starts furiously rubbing
      her hands together.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474842872840377
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri and Monika take a seat on the chest that's nearby.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474842872840379
    - rid: 9079474842872840380
    - rid: 9079474842872840381
    - rid: 9079474842872840382
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sayori helps me lay down on one of the nearby bed rolls.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We're... in...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I... think we'll just... rest here... for a... bit...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: No one seems to have any arguments with the next step of my master plan.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122292
    - rid: 9079474864314122293
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Good! I'd be really grouchy if they did!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, are you crazy?!?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474842872840383
    - rid: 9079474842872840384
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You could've died! <i>We</i> could've died!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I appreciate you being more concerned about my death than yours...
      heh!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well... yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It was risky, probably stupid, but it was the best I could come up with
      under the circumstances.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki, it isn't like {mc}'s plan was <i>actively</i> suicidal. Besides,
      it all worked out in the end.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474842872840385
    - rid: 9079474864314122291
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, but-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: If {mc} got hurt...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122294
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Aww, you like him? That's cute, Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122295
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: W-what? No!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122296
    - rid: 9079474864314122297
    - rid: 9079474864314122298
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And here I thought we were friends...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Sh-shut up! '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I-it would be bad if you got hurt because you know about this place,
      that's all!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122299
    - rid: 9079474864314122300
    - rid: 9079474864314122301
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... so I'm just a tour guide now? Harsh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: No, you're not just a-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122302
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, are you feeling warmer yet, Natsuki?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122305
    - rid: 9079474864314122306
    - rid: 9079474864314122307
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122303
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, yeah. This fire's been doing its job.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122304
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, well I feel ready to get going further in.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri gets up from the chest, while Sayori gets up from the other bedroll
      that she was sitting on.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122308
    - rid: 9079474864314122309
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, would this chest have anything in it worth taking?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122310
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Probably some septims and lockpicks.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'That reminds me, new ground-rule for everybody:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Being a loot goblin is not only acceptable, it is encouraged.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you're fine with the weight of taking it, you can grab anything that
      isn't nailed down.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, some chests might be booby-trapped...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: How would we be able to tell?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122311
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Honestly, trapped chests aren't very subtle.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There'll probably be some little rope mechanism attached to it, or weird
      openings nearby that have spikes hiding within.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, let's loot that chest and get going.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122312
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'Sure enough, my predictions come true:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The chest has a couple lockpicks, and seven septims.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122313
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: With our new-found treasure, we move on.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122314
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hachoo!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122315
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It is pretty dusty in here...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, the atmosphere here is very... oppressive.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122316
    - rid: 9079474864314122317
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm with ya.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hopefully we get used to it sooner rather than later...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122318
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I extend an arm to my side and put a finger to my lips, trying to get
      everyone to stop and be quiet.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122319
    - rid: 9079474864314122320
    - rid: 9079474864314122321
    - rid: 9079474864314122322
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (What're we stopping for?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I crouch down and point to the room ahead.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: When everyone notices the bandit standing by the lever at the center
      of that room, they join in on my lowered posture.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122323
    - rid: 9079474864314122324
    - rid: 9079474864314122325
    - rid: 9079474864314122326
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (What should we do, {mc}?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (There's only one of them, right? What's the matter?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (We don't need to do anything, we can just watch.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Just watch? Watch what?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I give Natsuki a pouty-squint, in an attempt to convey that all will
      be revealed in the fullness of time.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'Sure enough, what I expect to happen does:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The bandit walks towards the lever, pulls it and...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Gets riddled full of poisoned darts and keels over, dead.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122327
    - rid: 9079474864314122328
    - rid: 9079474864314122329
    - rid: 9079474864314122330
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Knowing the danger is over, I stand back up.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The rest of the girls shortly follow suit.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122332
    - rid: 9079474864314122334
    - rid: 9079474864314122335
    - rid: 9079474864314122336
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... they're acting just like in-game followers, heh!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, {mc}, how did you know that would happen?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which part? The bandit pulling the lever, or the darts?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uuhhh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122337
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122338
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Well:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122339
    - rid: 9079474864314122340
    - rid: 9079474864314122341
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: First of all, that bandit pulling the lever is a scripted sequence in
      the original game.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The player can interrupt it, but if they don't that bandit will always
      pull that lever and die, like an idiot.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Second of all, the reason why poisoned darts shot out when he pulled
      the lever?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's because the bandit didn't have the right combination.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: The right combination?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, do you see those obelisk/stone things toward the left?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I point toward Skyrim's notorious spinning-puzzle-rocks.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If those rocks were in the right combination, the gate would've opened
      instead.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, how do we figure out the combination?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's infuriatingly easy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I point toward the murals above the gate.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The first one has a picture of a snake...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There should be a second one there, but it fell to the floor over there.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It also has a picture of a snake.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Finally, the last one has a picture of a-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure it's supposed to be a whale, but I've always called it
      a dolphin.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Anyway, so the combination we need the rocks to show is: Snake, Snake,
      Dolphin.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: And how are we supposed to make the rocks show this correct combination?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We spin them!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I walk over the spinny-rocks, and try to twist them into position.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I don't really know how to do that, since in the game you just "interact"
      with them to make them spin.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I try placing my hands along the edges and twisting them around from
      there.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Surprisingly, a mechanism responds to my motion, completing the turn
      for me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Once all the correct faces are showing, I make my way to the lever.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122344
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I notice the girls deliberately take a step away from me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122345
    - rid: 9079474864314122346
    - rid: 9079474864314122347
    - rid: 9079474864314122348
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess they'd rather not take even the slightest chance of getting hit
      with some poison, even if I know what I'm doing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sure enough, when I pull the lever, the gate opens and no poison darts
      get flung.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: At this, the girls get closer again.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122349
    - rid: 9079474864314122350
    - rid: 9079474864314122351
    - rid: 9079474864314122352
    - rid: 9079474864314122355
    - rid: 9079474864314122356
    - rid: 9079474864314122357
    - rid: 9079474864314122358
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri crouches down next to the body of the dead bandit.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122354
    - rid: 9079474864314122359
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, Yuri, what are you doing?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Looting.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I thought you said we were supposed to take anything that wasn't nailed
      down...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ... s-so I figured I'd see if the bandit had anything worth taking...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122360
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <Speed=2>...</Speed>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You know what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You do your thing, Yuri.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122362
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri ruffles through the bandit's stuff for a bit.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: She comes out of the experience four septims richer.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122363
    - rid: 9079474864314122364
    - rid: 9079474864314122365
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122366
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Other than the bandits and that one trap, this place hasn't been too
      dangerous...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Don't jinx it, Monika.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We haven't met with the draugr yet.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122367
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... o-or th-th-that...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh? That?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122368
    - rid: 9079474864314122369
    - rid: 9079474864314122370
    - rid: 9079474864314122371
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Th-the g-g-giant frostb-b-ite... spider...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The girls follow my eyes up toward the webbed hole in the ceiling.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122372
    - rid: 9079474864314122373
    - rid: 9079474864314122374
    - rid: 9079474864314122375
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I-it s-s-eems they noticed it...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Heh! Whatcha gonna do, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122376
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122377
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122379
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, I was just teasing, you don't-...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287521
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: From the corner of my eye, I can see that Natsuki is still trying to
      talk to me, even if I can't hear her anymore.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122381
    - rid: 9079474864314122382
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The girls seem to be having a conversation.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122384
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I, however, just stare at the... thing up in the ceiling.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'Thinking the same thought over and over again, in hopes of manifesting
      it into reality:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <Speed=20>StayupthereStayupthereStayupthereStayupthereStayupthereStayupthereStayupthereStayupthere-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122385
    - rid: 9079475089592287522
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, are you okay?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122387
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: After I shared my "Amy Loves Spiders" poem, he did say that he was scared
      of spiders.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I didn't think it would be <i>this</i> bad, though.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122389
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=futura>Monika waves a hand in front of {mc}'s face.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=futura>He doesn't seem to react at all.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I don't think {mc}'s gonna be able to help us with that spider.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122388
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: What do you think we should do, Monika?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122390
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (What do you think?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474864314122391
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474884650467396
    - rid: 9079474884650467397
    - rid: 9079474884650467398
    - rid: 9079474884650467399
